      <section>
        <title>Assembly note</title>
        <para>This IPD projects only the parts explicitly defined in the current SSOT set. The section-level SSOT names the forward-fuselage branches but does not yet define a section assembly part number or a full section BOM.</para>
      </section>
      <section>
        <title>Known owned part entries at baseline</title>
        <para>Parent PN `PN-eWTW-5310-0001` — Radome.</para>
        <para>Owned child items: outer RF-transparent laminate skin; dielectric core A-sandwich; inner RF-transparent laminate skin; rain erosion boot/coating; attachment hinge and latch fittings; moisture seal and drainage provisions; bonding and ground provisions.</para>
        <para>Referenced external items only: lightning diverter strips (`REF-eWTW-LPS-DIVERTER`) and weather-radar antenna (`REF-eWTW-WXR-ANTENNA`).</para>
      </section>
